// A symlink named guide.bin or oversee.bin is not the cube.
// The read ignores it. The write replaces that link.
// Rank, concept, line, and the store stay.
// Ordinary program: no HOLD_FLASH line.

CUBE cubelink ROLE observer PROTON 1
CUBE law      ROLE nanobot  PROTON 1

PLUG cubelink law

IMPULSE cubelink 1
IMPULSE law 1
ENERGYFLOW 1
FLOW 1
HARMONY law
DECIDE law
ASSERT CUBES >= 2
PRINT "cubelink" UNITY DECIDE ENERGY
